    "name": "URL_Shortener",
    "description": "## URL Shortener API\n\nThis collection covers the complete workflow for interacting with the **URL Shortener API** — a service that allows authenticated users to create, manage, and delete shortened URLs.\n\n### Authentication\n\nBefore accessing any URL management endpoints, users must register and log in:\n\n- **CreateUserByEmail** — Register a new user account using an email address.\n    \n- **LoginUser** — Authenticate an existing user and obtain an access token.\n    \n\n### URL Management\n\nOnce authenticated, users can perform the following operations on shortened URLs:\n\n- **shortenURL** — Submit a long URL to receive a shortened version.\n    \n- **getAllURLs** — Retrieve a list of all shortened URLs associated with the authenticated user.\n    \n- **deleteURL** — Delete a specific shortened URL by its unique code.\n    \n\n### Environment\n\nThis collection uses the `{{BASE_URL}}` environment variable to define the base API endpoint. Make sure the **URL_Shortener** environment is selected before running any requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "53740980",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/53740980-d88b6236-94d2-42a0-a573-c68a4336603f?source=collection_link"
  },
